  "$Comment": "Ultimate rune 'Ice... KING!' cast (2026-10-22): the king's ultimate for a player: 1.2 s charge standing still (hand glow, his warning line), then 7 Stab hit boxes 0.37 s apart along your look line (40 blocks, 3 wide, 2.5 tall, line of sight): 6 ticks of 8 ice and a last hit of 24 + push + 2.5 s freeze. You can turn while it fires. Visible beam: the beam segments (Projectile_Config_AT_Ice_King_Rune_Beam), 6 per hit box 0.06 s apart; each hit box (Stab) runs 0.07 s after them (7 x 0.37 s as before). 2026-10-22: the first placeholder, the king's Aim_Tracer needle, never showed: its texture is 3x3 px and the client refuses textures that are not multiples of 32 (client log). Crown gate first (StatsCondition Costs 30 AT_Ice_Magic; only the Ice King crown raises its max), then the rune's own mana cost, as AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Ray_Cast. Poses: the king's own AT_Ice_King_Staff animations (his skeleton is the player rig; first person falls back to the vanilla staff cast). ",
